## Component Documentation

### TokenomicsOverview
The main container component for tokenomics documentation.

### TokenomicsSection
Represents a major section of tokenomics mechanics.

Props:
- `title`: string - The section title
- `type`: 'mechanism' | 'policy' | 'rule' - The type of tokenomics section
- `description`: string - A brief description of the section's purpose

### TokenomicsRule
Represents a specific rule or condition within a tokenomics section.

Props:
- `rule`: string - The specific rule or condition
- `type`: 'condition' | 'behavior' | 'mechanism' | 'action' - The type of rule
- `importance`: 'high' | 'medium' | 'low' - The importance level of the rule

## Usage Example

```tsx
<TokenomicsOverview>
  <TokenomicsSection
    title="Example Section"
    type="mechanism"
    description="Example tokenomics mechanism"
  >
    <TokenomicsRule
      rule="Example rule"
      type="condition"
      importance="high"
    />
  </TokenomicsSection>
</TokenomicsOverview>
```

## Notes
- Each section should have a clear, specific focus
- Rules should be ordered by importance
- All mechanisms should be clearly documented
- Maintain consistency in rule types and importance levels
- Update rules as tokenomics evolve
